        },
        {
          "text": "E’yo ’disi Yehova fe suru nyazani pa sozu okporu eri ma dria; te Yuda dria eji afa feza Yehosafati dri; eri ovu ndra lonyi be ekpete, inzita be tu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
